<title>UK: Argent sells distribution units to BT.</title>
<headline>Argent sells distribution units to BT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property development firm Argent Group Plc said on Friday it has sold two distribution units to British Telecom Pension Scheme for 38 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
